    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/306ddedb8d0f90d2a779b7f3324c65a5.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/9c5e199fe803c0663e363deeec81d78e.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/9c5e199fe803c0663e363deeec81d78e.webp?t=1754051293\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=220 /></picture></span>Join forces, strategize, and unleash your inner exterminator. Every round brings new challenges, hilarious teamwork, and unforgettable moments as you fight off endless mosquito hordes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/6d99043f63ba58370ec2df5df6b0a5f6.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/816d7a8414c813084a7ec506684e7e66.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/816d7a8414c813084a7ec506684e7e66.webm?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/816d7a8414c813084a7ec506684e7e66.mp4?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Want a twist? In PvP mode, one player is the Human, racing to complete chores and defend themselves with an ever-growing arsenal. The other four players become elite mosquitoes, evolving wild new powers\u2014like invisibility, teleportation, party heals, and more\u2014to outsmart and overwhelm the Human!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/90c621f48eda314c74568754a2142fe6.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/14b31accf01b244f64b87a486eab201f.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/14b31accf01b244f64b87a486eab201f.webm?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/14b31accf01b244f64b87a486eab201f.mp4?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new gadgets as a human or evolve your mosquito with blood-fueled abilities. Every match is packed with surprises, upgrades, and over-the-top action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/dcd8ce4a496c92e6481f354048c448d5.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/72b054a9cd83c6db694be5c9b53ddf16.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/72b054a9cd83c6db694be5c9b53ddf16.webm?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/72b054a9cd83c6db694be5c9b53ddf16.mp4?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle in the Scientist\u2019s House, brave the high-tech Toxor Labs, or crash the ultimate party on the Flagship. Each map offers fresh challenges and party vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/31620f3433714a7c268dd012da9ff124.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/5a6fb17eecf2037e105e48552f33819d.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/5a6fb17eecf2037e105e48552f33819d.webm?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/5a6fb17eecf2037e105e48552f33819d.mp4?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your human or mosquito with a huge range of unlockable outfits\u2014because even in the middle of a swarm, style counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The party has started\u2014grab your friends and jump into the mayhem! Play The Mosquito Gang now and see if you can survive the swarm!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/306ddedb8d0f90d2a779b7f3324c65a5.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/9c5e199fe803c0663e363deeec81d78e.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/9c5e199fe803c0663e363deeec81d78e.webp?t=1754051293\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=220 /></picture></span>Join forces, strategize, and unleash your inner exterminator. Every round brings new challenges, hilarious teamwork, and unforgettable moments as you fight off endless mosquito hordes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/6d99043f63ba58370ec2df5df6b0a5f6.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/816d7a8414c813084a7ec506684e7e66.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/816d7a8414c813084a7ec506684e7e66.webm?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/816d7a8414c813084a7ec506684e7e66.mp4?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Want a twist? In PvP mode, one player is the Human, racing to complete chores and defend themselves with an ever-growing arsenal. The other four players become elite mosquitoes, evolving wild new powers\u2014like invisibility, teleportation, party heals, and more\u2014to outsmart and overwhelm the Human!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/90c621f48eda314c74568754a2142fe6.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/14b31accf01b244f64b87a486eab201f.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/14b31accf01b244f64b87a486eab201f.webm?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/14b31accf01b244f64b87a486eab201f.mp4?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new gadgets as a human or evolve your mosquito with blood-fueled abilities. Every match is packed with surprises, upgrades, and over-the-top action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/dcd8ce4a496c92e6481f354048c448d5.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/72b054a9cd83c6db694be5c9b53ddf16.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/72b054a9cd83c6db694be5c9b53ddf16.webm?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/72b054a9cd83c6db694be5c9b53ddf16.mp4?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle in the Scientist\u2019s House, brave the high-tech Toxor Labs, or crash the ultimate party on the Flagship. Each map offers fresh challenges and party vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/31620f3433714a7c268dd012da9ff124.avif?t=1754051293\" width=800 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/5a6fb17eecf2037e105e48552f33819d.poster.avif?t=1754051293\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/5a6fb17eecf2037e105e48552f33819d.webm?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/5a6fb17eecf2037e105e48552f33819d.mp4?t=1754051293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your human or mosquito with a huge range of unlockable outfits\u2014because even in the middle of a swarm, style counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The party has started\u2014grab your friends and jump into the mayhem! Play The Mosquito Gang now and see if you can survive the swarm!</p>",
    "short_description": "The ultimate party game! In The Mosquito Gang, team up to battle mutant mosquito swarms in co-op PvE or fight in chaotic asymmetric PvP. Outrageous weapons, wild powers, and nonstop laughter\u2014bring the party to life!",
